Recipe Name: "philly" Stuffed Mushrooms�
Category...: Cyberealm, Vegetables, Appetizers
Servings...: 2
 
Ingredients:
FROM CHEF FREDDY'S-------------------
2 lb Fresh mushrooms [med size]
6 tb PARKAY margerine
8 oz Philadelphia Brand Cream
    -Cheese [softened]
1/2 c Kraft Natural blue cheese
    -[crumbled]
2 tb Onions [chopped]

Description:
Remove mushroom stems and chop of them to measure � cup... Cook half of the^
mushroom CAPS in 3 Tb of margarine over medium heat for 5 min., and then^
drain... Repeate with remaining mushrooms & margarine...^ Combine cream
cheese, blue cheese, mixing well until blended... Stir in^ chopped stems and
onions, then fill mushroom caps...  Place on cookie sheet^ and broil until
golden brown...^ brought to you by Fred Goslin, from the KRAFT Philadelphia
Cream Cheese^ Cookbook on Cyberealm Bbs (315)-785-8098 in Watertown NY^ ^ 
